{"_v":1,"id":"desire-under-the-elms-2009","cat":"broadway","bd":{"positive":2,"mixed":0,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Ben Brantley","o":"The New York Times","s":75,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.nytimes.com/2009/02/04/theater/reviews/04elms.html","d":"2009-04-28","q":"Ms. Mendes brings a bracing physicality to what can be a static, talky play, emphasizing the animal appetites that drive O'Neill's farming family toward destruction."},{"cn":"David Rooney","o":"Variety","s":75,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://variety.com/2009/legit/reviews/desire-under-the-elms-3-1200473054/","d":"2009-04-27","q":"Pablo Schreiber brings raw sexual magnetism and simmering volatility to his role as Eben, while Carla Gugino makes a persuasive Abbie."},{"cn":"Peter Marks","o":"The Washington Post","s":36,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/wp-dyn/content/article/2009/04/27/AR2009042703054.html","d":"2009-04-28","q":"What we get instead is a production that feels more like a high school staging of O'Neill than a Broadway revival worthy of the material's stature."}],"au":{"score":70,"designation":"Shrugging","sources":{"mz":{"s":70,"c":2,"sr":3.5}}},"bo":{"tw":null,"at":{"g":1381950,"p":48,"a":26397}},"ta":"246 W 44th St, New York, NY 10036","vs":{"sl":4,"so":4,"co":2,"am":5,"fa":3},"pd":"2009-04-14","ca":[{"n":"Brian Dennehy","r":"Ephraim Cabot"},{"n":"Carla Gugino","r":"Abbie Putnam"},{"n":"Pablo Schreiber","r":"Eben Cabot"},{"n":"Boris McGiver","r":"Peter Cabot"},{"n":"Daniel Stewart Sherman","r":"Simeon Cabot"}]}